{
    "$comment": [
        "THE BRAND PALETTE — the one place to change any colour in CelebrateMi.",
        "",
        "Read by BOTH toolchains, so there is exactly one source of truth:",
        "  • tailwind.config.js  imports this file and bakes the hexes into the",
        "    utility classes (bg-primary-500, text-ink-400, border-line, …).",
        "  • config/brand.php    exposes it to PHP; <x-brand-tokens /> then emits",
        "    the same values as CSS custom properties (--primary-500, --secondary,",
        "    --ink, --line, …) which every hand-written stylesheet consumes.",
        "",
        "Tailwind utilities read the CSS variable with the baked hex as a fallback,",
        "so editing this file recolours the whole app immediately. Run `npm run",
        "build` afterwards only to refresh the baked fallbacks.",
        "",
        "Keep every ramp at the 50…900 stops — both toolchains iterate these keys."
    ],

    "primary": {
        "50":  "#f7f4ff",
        "100": "#efe8ff",
        "200": "#ded1ff",
        "300": "#c4adff",
        "400": "#a680fc",
        "500": "#7c3aed",
        "600": "#6d28d9",
        "700": "#5b21b6",
        "800": "#4c1d95",
        "900": "#3c1a7a"
    },

    "secondary": {
        "50":  "#fff9ec",
        "100": "#fff0cd",
        "200": "#ffdf9b",
        "300": "#ffca63",
        "400": "#ffb43a",
        "500": "#f59e0b",
        "600": "#d97e06",
        "700": "#b45c09",
        "800": "#92480e",
        "900": "#783a0f"
    },

    "ink": {
        "50":  "#f8f7fb",
        "100": "#f1eff6",
        "200": "#e5e2ee",
        "300": "#cac5d8",
        "400": "#9d97ae",
        "500": "#6d6683",
        "600": "#544d68",
        "700": "#3e384e",
        "800": "#292336",
        "900": "#1d1828",
        "950": "#16121f"
    },

    "surface": {
        "base":   "#ffffff",
        "raised": "#faf8fe"
    },

    "state": {
        "ok":     { "base": "#0f7b57", "tint": "#e4f5ee" },
        "warn":   { "base": "#9a5b00", "tint": "#fdf1dd" },
        "danger": { "base": "#b4232d", "tint": "#fdeaec" }
    },

    "radius": {
        "sm":   "12px",
        "md":   "18px",
        "lg":   "26px",
        "pill": "999px"
    }
}
